wip/lib3mf: Import lib3mf-2.5.0

lib3mf is the 3MF Consortium's reference implementation of the 3D
Manufacturing Format (3MF).  Built from the GitHub release tag with
pkgsrc zlib, libzip and fast_float instead of the git submodules.
Needed by build123d (wip/py-build123d) through its Python binding
(wip/py-lib3mf).
